{"schemaVersion":1,"id":207,"sections":[{"id":"356003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20539],"start":0,"count":39},{"id":"356003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20540],"start":39,"count":44}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:1","scriptId":20539,"text":"时间过去了一周。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:2","scriptId":20539,"text":"死亡彗星小队这次搭乘了奢华的观光列车回来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:3","scriptId":20539,"text":"比正常列车要贵五倍的价格，能够享受观光与美食","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:4","scriptId":20539,"text":"“有钱真是好啊，偶尔进行一次列车旅行感觉真是不错～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":859,"speaker":"莎娃·叶尔马科夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:5","scriptId":20539,"text":"“高级牛排吃到饱～看到我们点单的数量，周围的人都呆了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":860,"speaker":"乔娜·马歇尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:6","scriptId":20539,"text":"“服务生当时吃惊的表情真是绝赞～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:7","scriptId":20539,"text":"“好了好了，我说你们两个追求也太低了，去搞点高端娱乐，不要整天想着吃吃吃的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":860,"right":780,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:8","scriptId":20539,"text":"虽然很早就完成了任务，但死亡彗星这次硬是在外面拖延了很久才返回死水。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":860,"right":780,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:9","scriptId":20539,"text":"一段纸醉金迷的小休假。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":860,"right":780,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":860,"speaker":"乔娜·马歇尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:10","scriptId":20539,"text":"“还好吧，品尝美食也是一种享受。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":860,"right":780,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":859,"speaker":"莎娃·叶尔马科夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:11","scriptId":20539,"text":"“就是就是～我们只要满足果腹这个小小愿望就非常幸福了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":860,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:12","scriptId":20539,"text":"“说的比唱的还好听～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:14","scriptId":20539,"text":"三人有说有笑，一路走下站台。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:15","scriptId":20539,"text":"在刚要离开车站的时候，她们看到了几位熟悉的人。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:16","scriptId":20539,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":860,"speaker":"乔娜·马歇尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:17","scriptId":20539,"text":"“站在那里的不是维多利亚团长吗？我没看错吧，副团长也在？还有一个小队是艾莉丝？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":860,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":859,"speaker":"莎娃·叶尔马科夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:18","scriptId":20539,"text":"“你没看错，但是她们怎么会在这里，难道我们的事情被发现了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:19","scriptId":20539,"text":"“莎娃，不会说话就把嘴闭上，让我来应付。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":859,"speaker":"莎娃·叶尔马科夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:20","scriptId":20539,"text":"“哦、哦……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:21","scriptId":20539,"text":"虽然莎娃和乔娜有些动摇，但是莉安娜很快让她们安静了下来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:22","scriptId":20539,"text":"三人就这样走到了维多利亚的身边。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":859,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":980,"speaker":"蒂娅·温莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:23","scriptId":20539,"text":"“你们这是任务刚回来？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:24","scriptId":20539,"text":"发问的是副团长蒂娅。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:25","scriptId":20539,"text":"“是的，因为这次任务有点累，所以回来的时候就稍微奢侈了一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":980,"speaker":"蒂娅·温莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:26","scriptId":20539,"text":"“恩，用公款吃喝？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:27","scriptId":20539,"text":"“怎么可能～当然是私费啦，再说了死水本来就不给补贴资金何来公款一说～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:28","scriptId":20539,"text":"莉安娜神情自若，但莎娃和乔娜的脸色已经有点发青。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":980,"speaker":"蒂娅·温莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:29","scriptId":20539,"text":"“你误会了，我的意思是你们出卖了死水的情报给特勤局，这情报费自然是一种公款咯～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:30","scriptId":20539,"text":"“情报？什么情报？战车兽的吗？那种情报卖点给特勤局不疼不痒吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:31","scriptId":20539,"text":"感觉到这两人的对话可能就要这样徘徊下去，维多利亚团长开口了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:32","scriptId":20539,"text":"“你看看这是什么。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":547,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:33","scriptId":20539,"text":"维多利亚给了艾莉丝一个信号，艾莉丝取出一个信封，丢给了莉安娜。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":547,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":8,"speaker":"艾莉丝·戴高乐","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:34","scriptId":20539,"text":"“幸亏有蕾贝卡的通知，我们才能预先埋伏在你们的交易地点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:35","scriptId":20539,"text":"“……！！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:36","scriptId":20539,"text":"莉安娜打开信封，里面满是照片……从中抽出一枚，正巧是她在和铁血队长艾米丽交谈的照片。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":8,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:37","scriptId":20539,"text":"“证据确凿，那么接下来……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":547,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":980,"speaker":"蒂娅·温莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:38","scriptId":20539,"text":"“该到教育叛徒的时间了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:39","scriptId":20539,"text":"蒂娅一马当先站了出来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-PROLOGUE:20539:40","scriptId":20539,"text":"“哼，蕾贝卡那家伙竟然算计我。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:1","scriptId":20540,"text":"虽然死亡彗星小队也是善战的队伍，但仍旧无法和蒂娅她们抗衡。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:2","scriptId":20540,"text":"短短几个回合死亡彗星小队就败下阵来。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":780,"right":980,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":980,"speaker":"蒂娅·温莎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:3","scriptId":20540,"text":"“恩，战斗方面确实是可圈可点的队伍，但只可惜我比你们强了那么一点点。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":980,"right":980,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:4","scriptId":20540,"text":"“切，根本不是一个等级的怪物，要杀要剐悉听尊便。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":980,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:5","scriptId":20540,"text":"被五花大绑的莉安娜已然摆出了一副要上刑场的态度。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":980,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:6","scriptId":20540,"text":"“先回死水吧，我不喜欢在外面处理家丑。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:7","scriptId":20540,"text":"维多利亚冷冷地说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:9","scriptId":20540,"text":"于是一行人便就压着死亡彗星小队返回死水总部。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-130.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:11","scriptId":20540,"text":"死水团长室——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:12","scriptId":20540,"text":"“从蕾贝卡和艾莉丝的调查报告总结，事情的经过就是这样，你还有什么要补充的吗？莉安娜？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:13","scriptId":20540,"text":"从维多利亚的口气上推断，莉安娜她们的交易从最初就完全处于暴露状态。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:14","scriptId":20540,"text":"“……原来从一开始你们就已经掌握了关键情报。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:15","scriptId":20540,"text":"“很遗憾，正是如此。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:16","scriptId":20540,"text":"“既然你们都知道到了，我也就没什么好多说的了，大不了就是一死。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:17","scriptId":20540,"text":"“唉……我说莉安娜啊，你平时脑袋挺灵活的，怎么到关键时刻就不管用了呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:18","scriptId":20540,"text":"“什么意思？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:19","scriptId":20540,"text":"“你有没有想过，如果从一开始我们就知道你要把空钢的设计图卖给特勤局，那我们为什么没有阻止你呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:20","scriptId":20540,"text":"“…………”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:21","scriptId":20540,"text":"莉安娜沉思了一会儿，她马上就发现了其中的问题。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:22","scriptId":20540,"text":"“难道你们是故意让我这么做的！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:23","scriptId":20540,"text":"“正是如此，特勤局已经不止一次来刺探我们的空钢测试结果，说实话，我早就不耐烦了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:24","scriptId":20540,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:25","scriptId":20540,"text":"“我倒是有意把空钢的设计交给特勤局共同开发来着，但实在不喜欢特勤局偷鸡摸狗的小伎俩和自鸣得意的态度。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:26","scriptId":20540,"text":"“而且把研究成果拱手让人这种摇尾乞怜的事情我们死水也不会做。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:27","scriptId":20540,"text":"听到这里莉安娜不由得笑了起来……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:28","scriptId":20540,"text":"“真是可笑……我们这次盗取设计图的计划被你们彻头彻尾地给利用了呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:29","scriptId":20540,"text":"“哼，你那点小鸡肚肠怎么能瞒得过我的眼睛，当年把你招进死水的人可是我啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:30","scriptId":20540,"text":"“那么接下来……你们死亡彗星小队转卖死水重要情报的事情，论军纪是要处以极刑的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:31","scriptId":20540,"text":"“哼……果然还是逃不过嘛……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:32","scriptId":20540,"text":"莉安娜像是接受了这个结果一般，长叹了一口气。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:33","scriptId":20540,"text":"“不过……如果你答应我接下来的条件的话，我可以考虑免你们一死。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:34","scriptId":20540,"text":"没想到维多利亚在这种时候还会抛给自己救命稻草，莉安娜的眼神中又充满了光芒。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:35","scriptId":20540,"text":"“什么条件？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:36","scriptId":20540,"text":"“继续担当死水和特勤局之间的‘桥梁’。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:37","scriptId":20540,"text":"“这……你的意思是让我当双面间谍？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:38","scriptId":20540,"text":"“怎么？这条件很苛刻吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:39","scriptId":20540,"text":"“不……这对我们来说实在是太合算了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:40","scriptId":20540,"text":"“怎么可能，你们这次交易所得的资金都将收缴，并且根据你们这次恶劣的行为，我还会额外开据罚单。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:41","scriptId":20540,"text":"“呃……你还是杀了我吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:42","scriptId":20540,"text":"莉安娜受到了巨大的打击……顿时觉得两眼一黑。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:43","scriptId":20540,"text":"“这次的事情我就把它封入死水的黑历史了，以后谁也不许再提。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":547,"speaker":"维多利亚·威灵顿","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:44","scriptId":20540,"text":"“考虑到你接下来的工作风险比较大，所以我会增加你的报酬。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":780,"speaker":"莉安娜·弗洛森","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:45","scriptId":20540,"text":"“遵命……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"356003-EPILOGUE:20540:46","scriptId":20540,"text":"听到维多利亚这么说，莉安娜便没有更多的怨言了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-098.webp","left":547,"right":780,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
